Subject: IR2 Parser Projection Expected Validation Ledger
Date: 2026-05-26
Expected Ledger UUID: 49d3e234-1c00-4c96-9b4b-c07bfae49c9c

& [ExpectedValidationLedger: IR2ParserProjection] is the expected validation ledger for IR2 fixtures
  + [fixture_set] is ir2_parser_projection
  + [ledger_status] is expected_output_authority_after_IR2-IA02_review
  + [required_field_set] is fixture_id, validation_subject_ref, expected_hash_check_status, expected_signature_check_status, expected_lineage_check_status, expected_freshness_check_status, expected_authority_classification, expected_proof_result_status, expected_fault_or_interrupt, proof_limit, and acceptance_status

& [ExpectedValidationCases] is the expected validation case set
  + [case] is valid_signed_canonical_artifact | hash_runtime_check | signature_valid | lineage_present | current | signed_sjs_authority_candidate | accepted | none
  + [case] is source_only_unprocessed_artifact | hash_runtime_check | signature_absent_allowed_for_source | lineage_not_required | current | source_only | not_authority | unprocessed_source
  + [case] is missing_signature_canonical_artifact | hash_runtime_check | signature_missing | lineage_present | current | blocked | fault | missing_signature
  + [case] is wrong_protocol_signature | hash_runtime_check | signature_wrong_protocol | lineage_present | current | blocked | fault | wrong_protocol
  + [case] is stale_source_hash | hash_mismatch | signature_stale | lineage_present | stale | blocked | fault | stale_source_hash
  + [case] is malformed_sop_structure | hash_runtime_check | signature_not_reached | lineage_unknown | unknown | blocked | parser_fault | malformed_line
  + [case] is unresolved_natural_key | hash_runtime_check | signature_valid | lineage_present | current | blocked | fault | unresolved_identity
  + [case] is broken_lineage | hash_runtime_check | signature_valid | lineage_missing | current | blocked | fault | broken_lineage
  + [case] is generated_projection_non_authority | hash_runtime_check | signature_not_authority | lineage_generated | current | projection_only | not_authority | generated_projection
  + [case] is source_mutation_refusal | hash_runtime_check | signature_not_required | lineage_present | current | refused | fault | source_mutation_forbidden
